id=cos-ifs
name=COS-IFS installer forwarder
version=0.7
versionCode=7
author=k_ying
description=[中文] 用转发壳替换系统安装器 com.android.packageinstaller：壳里没有任何安装器逻辑，只把安装/卸载请求转发给你自己安装的第三方安装器（InstallerX Revived、Universal Installer 等），所以上游安装器怎么更新都与本模块无关。转发目标只认你在 WebUI 里选中的那一个；没选就用内置默认（InstallerX Revived）—— 壳不会去猜。需要元模块 Hybrid Mount，并把本模块的后端设为 VFS。已在 ColorOS 17 / PLK110 真机验证：正常开机、列出候选、切换目标、接管安装。 [EN] Replaces the system installer com.android.packageinstaller with a forwarding shell. The shell contains no installer logic; it re-dispatches install/uninstall requests to a third-party installer you installed yourself (InstallerX Revived, Universal Installer, ...), so upstream installer updates need nothing from this module. The target is the single installer you pick in the WebUI; with nothing picked it uses the built-in default (InstallerX Revived) -- the shell never guesses. Requires the Hybrid Mount metamodule with this module's backend set to VFS. VERIFIED on a real device (ColorOS 17 / PLK110): boots, lists candidates, switches targets, takes over installs.
